EventPointerTable(0xA6, PointerList)

ALIGN 4
PointerList:
POIN TurnBasedEvents
POIN CharacterBasedEvents
POIN LocationBasedEvents
POIN MiscBasedEvents
POIN Dunno1 Dunno2 Dunno3 Tutorial
POIN Traps1 Traps2
POIN Good Good  //This unit group determines the number and position of deployment slots when there is a prep screen
POIN $0 $0 $0
POIN $0 $0 $0
POIN BeginningScene EndingScene

TurnBasedEvents:
END_MAIN

CharacterBasedEvents:
END_MAIN

LocationBasedEvents:
END_MAIN

MiscBasedEvents:
CauseGameOverIfLordDies
END_MAIN

Dunno1:
END_MAIN

Dunno2:
END_MAIN

Dunno3:
END_MAIN

Tutorial:
END_MAIN

Good:
UNIT Marth EirikaMasterLord 0x00 Level(1,Ally,0) [13,8] 0x0  0x0 0x0 0x0 [SilverSword, Vulnerary] NoAI
UNIT

Bad:
UNIT

Traps1:
ENDTRAP
ALIGN 4

Traps2:
ENDTRAP
ALIGN 4

BeginningScene:
EVBIT_MODIFY 1 //No skipping
SetBackground(CGBlackScreen)
TUTORIALTEXTBOXSTART
CenterTutorialTextBox
TEXTSHOW InterludeNotification
TEXTEND
STAL 10
SVAL s1 1
BNE 6001 sC s1 //branch if no

EVBIT_MODIFY 0 //skip away, though if you're going to you should hit yes
FADI 60
STAL 1
CALL $9EE2C4 //EndConvo, get rid of black screen
STAL 10
Text(PlaceholderText)
CALL EndingScene
ENDA

//End chapter early
LABEL 6001
TUTORIALTEXTBOXSTART
CenterTutorialTextBox
TEXTSHOW InterludeSkipped
TEXTEND
CALL EndingScene
ENDA

EndingScene:
MNC2 0x7
ENDB

